## Summary

All frontend changes complete. Here's what was done:

### New File
- **`frontend/js/fingerprint.js`** — Device fingerprint collection module
  - Collects: `screen_resolution`, `canvas_hash`, `webgl_hash`, `user_agent`, `timezone`
  - Computes SHA-256 of combined values → `fingerprint_hash`
  - Injects into `window.DDW_FINGERPRINT`
  - Auto-collects on DOMContentLoaded

### Modified Files

**`frontend/login.html`** — Complete rewrite:
- Removed old SMS/PIN dual tab and broken endpoints (`/auth/sms/request`, `/auth/sms/verify`, `/auth/pin/login`)
- Single form: phone + password + captcha (4-char input + image + "换一张")
- Calls `/api/v1/auth/login-password` with `captcha_id`, `captcha_code`, `device_fingerprint`
- 429 → Retry-After countdown display
- "Remember account" checkbox → localStorage
- No Dev Code toast

**`frontend/welcome.html`**:
- Added captcha components to both register and login forms
- Register now sends `captcha_id` + `captcha_code` (no SMS code)
- Login sends `device_fingerprint` from fingerprint.js
- Removed old `sendCode()` function
- Loads `fingerprint.js`

**`frontend/saas-register.html`**:
- Added captcha components to register and login forms
- Register now requires password (min 8 chars) + captcha
- Login sends `captcha_id` + `captcha_code` + `device_fingerprint`
- Removed old SMS send-code flow
- Loads `fingerprint.js`

